that he was hoping to avoid by going on vacation.
原本希望通过去度假来逃避的事情。

451
00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:16.960
And she says, Michael, we can't do inventory without you.
她说，迈克尔，没有你我们没法盘点库存。

452
00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:17.740
We had to wait.
我们不得不等。

453
00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:19.660
It has to be done today.
这事今天必须得做完。

454
00:23:21.660 --> 00:23:23.300
He is so bummed out.
他非常沮丧。

455
00:23:23.460 --> 00:23:24.980
He hates doing inventory.
他讨厌盘点库存。

456
00:23:24.980 --> 00:23:26.000
He says it's boring.
他说这很无聊。

457
00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:28.000
So he decides to make it a party.
所以他决定把它变成一场派对。

458
00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:32.500
And he tells Angela, get the party planning committee together.
他告诉安吉拉，把派对策划委员会召集起来。

459
00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:35.700
We're going to have a luau this afternoon.
我们今天下午要办一场夏威夷派对。

460
00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:37.900
And she is not having it.
但她根本不买账。

461
00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:38.660
She's like, what?
她当时就像是，什么？

462
00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:44.940
At four minutes, you get a shot of a real snarky expression from Angela Martin about this
在第四分钟，你看到了安吉拉·马丁对这场她现在不得不筹办的

463
00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:46.680
luau that she now has to throw.
夏威夷派对露出了一个非常刻薄的表情。

464
00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:54.520
But please look at the outfit, crazy blouse with a high collar, froofy collar, argyle
但请看看这身装扮，疯狂的衬衫配着高领，那种褶皱领，还有菱形格纹

