00:24:12.460 --> 00:24:17.200
wearing the same one you wore in Benihana Christmas because it looks almost identical?
是不是你在《班尼哈纳圣诞节》里穿的那件，因为看起来几乎一模一样？

470
00:24:17.580 --> 00:24:18.720
No, it is not.
不，不是。

471
00:24:18.780 --> 00:24:23.880
This season, the wardrobe department had bought me all of these high collared, froofy blouses,
这一季，服装部门给我买了所有这些高领、褶皱领的衬衫，

