00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:27.340
which only live this season and never come back.
它们只在这一季出现，之后再也没出现过。

473
00:24:28.500 --> 00:24:30.040
But that is not the same one.
但那件不是同一件。

474
00:24:30.160 --> 00:24:31.840
It's yet another froofy blouse.
那是另一件褶皱衬衫。

475
00:24:32.040 --> 00:24:37.820
Well, now we go into the conference room, Angela, because Michael wants everyone to watch a video
好了，现在我们进入会议室，安吉拉，因为迈克尔想让大家看一个关于“岛屿生活”的视频

