00:24:37.820 --> 00:24:42.000
slideshow on Island Life, and a big thing happens.
幻灯片，然后发生了一件大事。

477
00:24:42.860 --> 00:24:45.360
Karen does not sit next to Jim.
凯伦没有坐在吉姆旁边。

478
00:24:45.900 --> 00:24:46.220
Yeah.
没错。

479
00:24:47.040 --> 00:24:48.060
It's serious.
这很严重。

480
00:24:48.340 --> 00:24:49.440
This fight is serious.
这次吵架很严重。

481
00:24:49.800 --> 00:24:56.080
